# Environment configuration
# In Release/Production builds (e.g. flutter build apk/web or prod deployment),
# the app automatically connects to https://hms.sriponnimedicalcentre.com/api.
# 
# For local development (debug mode), default is http://localhost:3000/api (or 10.0.2.2:3000 on Android emulator).
# Uncomment below if you need a specific custom backend IP during local testing:
# BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
# BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.35:3000/api
